        (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top))
        (uuid "a02547bc-731b-485e-a57a-dc61b9b6f6bd"))
(text "LSM6DSOX: 3.3V I2C, 0x6A\nINT1 -> GPIO22; INT2 -> TP6 only\nST Mode 1: SDx/SCx tied GND;\nOCS_Aux/SDO_Aux NC lands soldered.\nC23/C24: 100nF at respective pins.\nNo hub/OIS/pass-through in firmware." (at 165.1 220.98 0)
        (effects (font (size 0.889 0.889)) (justify left top))
        (uuid "28298682-27d6-4ee6-ad2a-5cfa83da4796"))
(text "No second regulator or level shifter.\nR14/R15: existing 10K I2C pull-ups.\nBus rise time remains a layout check." (at 248.92 160.02 0)
        (effects (font (size 0.889 0.889)) (justify left top))
        (uuid "0ef5bbdf-bbb2-4258-938e-1de54d42df3e"))

