(text "5V-CLASS AUDIO BOOST (Adafruit 4654-derived)\nEN follows GPIO23 POWER; existing R17 supplies default pulldown.\nR1 default-on pull-up omitted. Input remains behind Q1/Q2.\nPower MPNs / effective capacitance not frozen.\nC29: optional feed-forward; resolve for >40uF effective Cout." (at 302.26 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "738c4172-0ca6-5d4c-b312-a00d5662ebdd"))
(text "GPIO19 BUTTON HARNESS\nJ2 -> 1K -> GPIO; 10K pull-up, 10nF filter.\nFirmware debounce + final cable/ESD review required." (at 175.26 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7fdb3b8-b10a-5e3d-ae8b-dafec9873318"))
(text "Q4 / GPIO20: HIGH = SHUTDOWN\n4.7K pull-up dominates RP2040 reset pulldown.\nDrive mute HIGH before enabling POWER.\nSupply collapse/pop behavior remains a bench gate." (at 304.8 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6e92ded2-9dd0-5d0e-b998-d7890276a615"))
(text "SPEAKER: isolated BTL pair, 4 ohm target\n3W high-end != qualified continuous speaker power.\nMolex Pico-Lock, not battery JST-PH or button JST-SH." (at 307.34 201.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3ba1db2b-e758-595e-9c4f-d83be8235c22"))
